---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import mascot from '../assets/amira-mascot.png';
---
<div class="config-window">
  <div class="showcase-header"><div><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span><strong data-mentor-name>Web Mentor</strong></div><span class="subtle-badge">Interactive concept preview</span></div>
  <div class="showcase-body">
    <div class="config-editor">
      <div class="editor-header"><div><span class="room-label">01 / TEACHER GUIDANCE</span><h3>Shape how it helps.</h3><p>Choose a subject and approach. See how the guidance changes.</p></div></div>
      <div class="subject-control"><label for="subject-select">Learning context</label><select id="subject-select"><option value="web">Web Development</option><option value="math">Mathematics</option><option value="language">Language Arts</option></select></div>
      <div class="guidance-control"><span class="control-label" id="guidance-label">How should AMIRA help?</span><div class="guidance-choices" role="group" aria-labelledby="guidance-label"><button type="button" data-guidance="question" class="is-active" aria-pressed="true"><Icon name="chat" size={19} /><strong>Ask first</strong><span>Start with their effort</span></button><button type="button" data-guidance="hint" aria-pressed="false"><Icon name="bulb" size={19} /><strong>Give a hint</strong><span>Find a small next step</span></button><button type="button" data-guidance="reflect" aria-pressed="false"><Icon name="replay" size={19} /><strong>Reflect</strong><span>Explore the reasoning</span></button></div></div>
      <div class="editor-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Sample mentor settings"><button id="tab-instructions" class="is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="panel-instructions" tabindex="0" data-config-tab="instructions">Instructions</button><button id="tab-resources" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-resources" tabindex="-1" data-config-tab="resources">Resources</button><button id="tab-behavior" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-behavior" tabindex="-1" data-config-tab="behavior">Approach</button></div>
      <div id="panel-instructions" class="editor-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-instructions" tabindex="0"><div class="instruction-code" data-instructions><p class="instruction-role">Be a patient web development mentor.</p><ul><li>Start with what the student has already tried.</li><li>Offer small hints the student can test.</li><li>Ask the student to explain why the fix worked.</li></ul><div class="instruction-focus"><span>Guidance focus</span><p>Start with what the student has already tried.</p></div></div></div>
      <div id="panel-resources" class="editor-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-resources" tabindex="0" hidden><div class="field-label">LEARNING RESOURCES</div><div class="resource-list" data-resources></div><p class="resource-note">Sample resources that give the mentor learning context.</p></div>
      <div id="panel-behavior" class="editor-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-behavior" tabindex="0" hidden><div class="field-label">GUIDANCE PRINCIPLES</div><div class="behavior-list"><p><span>01</span> Use friendly, clear language.</p><p><span>02</span> Ask what the student has tried before offering hints.</p><p><span>03</span> Guide the student one step at a time.</p><p><span>04</span> Encourage the student to test and explain the result.</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="config-outcome" role="region" aria-label="Sample learning guidance" aria-live="polite">
      <span class="room-label">02 / STUDENT EXPERIENCE</span><h3>A next step to try.</h3>
      <div class="student-prompt"><span>THE STUDENT ASKS</span><p data-preview-question>Why isn't my CSS loading? I've added a link tag in my HTML.</p></div>
      <div class="preview-response"><div class="response-speaker"><span class="response-avatar" aria-hidden="true"><Image src={mascot} alt="" width={90} widths={[90, 180]} sizes="90px" format="webp" quality={85} loading="lazy" /></span><div><strong>AMIRA</strong><span data-guidance-caption>Start with what the student has already tried.</span></div></div><p data-outcome>“What have you tried so far? Let's look at one part of the code first.”</p></div>
      <div class="student-action"><span><Icon name="check" size={17} /> THE NEXT STEP</span><p data-student-step>Share the code and explain what they have already tried.</p></div>
      <a href="#learning" class="outcome-link">Explore the conversation <Icon size={17} /></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
.config-window{display:block;border:1.5px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:25px;min-height:0;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 0 -6px var(--surface);background:var(--white)}
.showcase-header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:18px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface)}
.showcase-header>div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:13px}.showcase-header .subtle-badge{font-size:10px;padding:5px 9px;background:var(--warm-soft);color:var(--ink)}
.showcase-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.04fr 1fr}.config-editor{padding:32px;min-width:0;background:var(--white)}.editor-header{display:block}.room-label{display:block;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.07em;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:13px}.editor-header h3,.config-outcome h3{font-size:29px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.02em}.editor-header p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.85;margin-top:10px;max-width:440px}.subject-control{display:flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:25px}.subject-control label{font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.subject-control select{color:var(--ink);background:var(--white);border-color:var(--stroke);font-size:12px;padding:10px 26px 10px 12px;max-width:210px;border-radius:10px}.guidance-control{margin-top:22px}.control-label{font-size:12px;margin-bottom:11px}.guidance-choices{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px}.guidance-choices button{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:5px;padding:13px 11px;border-radius:13px;font-size:11px;background:var(--white);color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--stroke);line-height:1.55}.guidance-choices button svg{margin-bottom:3px;color:var(--muted)}.guidance-choices button strong{font-size:12px}.guidance-choices button span{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.guidance-choices button.is-active,.guidance-choices button[data-guidance=hint].is-active,.guidance-choices button[data-guidance=reflect].is-active{color:var(--white);background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink)}.guidance-choices button.is-active svg{color:var(--gold)}.guidance-choices button.is-active span{color:var(--white)}.editor-tabs{border-bottom-color:var(--line);gap:27px;margin-top:25px}.editor-tabs button{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;padding-bottom:12px}.editor-tabs button.is-active{color:var(--ink);border-bottom-color:var(--ink)}.editor-panel{margin-top:18px;min-height:230px}.instruction-code{padding:0;background:transparent;border:0;border-radius:0;font:12px/1.85 var(--font);color:var(--muted);margin-top:0}.instruction-role{font-size:13px;font-weight:750;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.8}.instruction-code ul{margin:12px 0 0;padding-left:19px}.instruction-code li{padding:2px 0;color:var(--muted)}.instruction-focus{margin-top:17px;padding:13px 15px;border-left:3px solid var(--gold);border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;background:var(--warm-soft)}.instruction-focus>span{display:block;color:var(--ink);font-size:10px;font-weight:750}.instruction-focus p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.85;margin-top:5px;color:var(--ink)}.field-label{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.resource-file{padding:14px 1px;border-bottom-color:var(--line)}.resource-file>span{color:var(--accent)}.resource-file strong{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink)}.resource-file div>span{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.resource-note{font-size:11px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--muted)}.behavior-list p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;padding:10px 0;color:var(--ink);border-bottom-color:var(--line)}.behavior-list span{font-size:11px;color:var(--accent)}
.config-outcome{display:flex;flex-direction:column;grid-column:auto;gap:0;padding:32px;border-left:1px solid var(--stroke);border-top:0;background:var(--surface-alt);min-width:0}.config-outcome>.room-label{color:var(--accent-ink)}.config-outcome h3{margin:0;color:var(--ink)}.student-prompt{margin:25px 0 18px;padding:14px 17px;border-radius:14px 14px 3px 14px;background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--stroke);align-self:flex-end;width:90%}.student-prompt>span{font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent-ink);letter-spacing:.05em}.student-prompt p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--ink);margin-top:5px}.preview-response{padding:20px;border-radius:18px;background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--stroke);box-shadow:0 4px 0 var(--surface)}.response-speaker{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px}.response-avatar{position:relative;display:block;width:43px;height:43px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:13px;background:var(--warm-soft);overflow:hidden}.response-avatar img{position:absolute;max-width:none;width:90px;height:90px;object-fit:contain;left:-8px;top:-3px}.response-speaker strong{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink)}.response-speaker div>span{display:block;font-size:10px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);max-width:290px;margin-top:3px}.preview-response>p{font-family:var(--heading);font-size:24px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:750;color:var(--accent-ink);margin-top:18px}.student-action{margin-top:22px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px dashed var(--stroke)}.student-action>span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.04em;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent-ink)}.student-action p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--muted);margin-top:9px}.outcome-link{font-size:12px;padding-top:20px;margin-top:auto;gap:10px;color:var(--ink)}
@media(max-width:1150px){.config-editor,.config-outcome{padding:26px}.editor-header h3,.config-outcome h3{font-size:26px}.guidance-choices button{padding:12px 9px}.guidance-choices button strong{font-size:11px}.guidance-choices button span{font-size:9px}.subject-control label{font-size:11px}.subject-control select{font-size:11px;max-width:190px}.preview-response>p{font-size:22px}}
@media(max-width:900px){.showcase-body{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.showcase-header{padding:17px 22px}.config-editor,.config-outcome{padding:24px 20px}.editor-header h3,.config-outcome h3{font-size:25px}.subject-control{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px}.subject-control select{width:100%;max-width:none}.guidance-choices{grid-template-columns:1fr}.guidance-choices button{display:grid;grid-template-columns:20px 1fr;gap:0 10px;padding:10px}.guidance-choices button svg{grid-row:1/3;align-self:center;margin:0}.guidance-choices button span{font-size:10px}.guidance-choices button strong{font-size:12px}.preview-response{padding:16px}.preview-response>p{font-size:21px}.student-prompt{width:100%;padding:13px}.student-prompt p,.student-action p{font-size:12px}.editor-panel{min-height:255px}}
@media(max-width:640px){.config-window{border-radius:19px}.showcase-header{padding:15px 17px}.showcase-header>div{font-size:11px;gap:8px}.showcase-header .brand-mark{width:18px;height:18px}.showcase-header .subtle-badge{font-size:8px;padding:4px 6px}.showcase-body{grid-template-columns:1fr}.config-editor,.config-outcome{padding:25px 21px}.room-label{font-size:9px;margin-bottom:11px}.editor-header h3,.config-outcome h3{font-size:27px}.editor-header p{font-size:12px}.subject-control{flex-wrap:nowrap;margin-top:21px}.subject-control label{font-size:11px}.subject-control select{font-size:11px;width:auto;max-width:180px}.guidance-control{margin-top:20px}.control-label{font-size:11px}.guidance-choices{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:6px}.guidance-choices button{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:11px 5px;gap:5px;text-align:center}.guidance-choices button svg{align-self:center;grid-row:auto;width:18px;height:18px}.guidance-choices button strong{font-size:10px}.guidance-choices button span{display:none}.editor-tabs{gap:26px;margin-top:23px}.editor-tabs button{font-size:12px;padding-bottom:11px}.editor-panel{min-height:205px;margin-top:17px}.instruction-code{font-size:12px;line-height:1.85}.instruction-role{font-size:12px}.instruction-focus{padding:11px 12px;margin-top:14px}.instruction-focus p{font-size:12px}.config-outcome{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--stroke);grid-column:auto}.student-prompt{margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:16px;padding:13px 15px;width:95%}.student-prompt p{font-size:12px}.preview-response{padding:17px}.preview-response>p{font-size:23px}.response-speaker div>span{font-size:10px}.student-action{margin-top:19px;padding-top:18px}.student-action p{font-size:12px}.outcome-link{font-size:12px;padding-top:19px}.resource-file strong{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink)}.resource-note{font-size:11px}.behavior-list p{font-size:12px}}
@media(max-width:360px){.showcase-header{padding-inline:14px}.showcase-header .subtle-badge{font-size:7px}.config-editor,.config-outcome{padding-inline:17px}.editor-header h3,.config-outcome h3{font-size:25px}.subject-control{flex-wrap:wrap}.subject-control select{width:100%;max-width:none}.guidance-choices button strong{font-size:9px}.preview-response>p{font-size:21px}}
</style>
